        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLCOVCOM, Soleil Single Cylinder Entryset with Black Glass Coventry Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Soleil Single Cylinder Entryset with Black Glass Coventry Knob is a unique way to add security to your front door. It offers both style and security. The Soleil Entryset with Coventry Knob is available in many finishes. This Soleil Rosette with Coventry Knob and Deadbolt Combo Pack comes with 2 knobs and a single cylinder deadbolt.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLCOVCOM Single Cylinder Soleil Entryset with Black Glass Knob:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Soleil Rosette with Coventry Knob and Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette and Deadbolt Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Black Glass</li>\r\n<li>Coventry Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Coventry Knob Projection: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Soleil Rosette Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLCOV-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262385\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLCOVCOM Entryset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
